<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="h-100" lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>¡No te dejes atrapar! Online</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-1BmE4kWBq78iYhFldvKuhfTAU6auU8tT94WrHftjDbrCEXSU1oBoqyl2QvZ6jIW3" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <style>
      .icon {
        font-size: 2em;
        width: 1em;
        margin-right: 0.5em;
        margin-left: -0.25em;
        text-align: center;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      #challenge-list > li:hover {
        cursor: pointer;
        background: #e9ecef;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="d-flex flex-column h-100">
    <main class="flex-shrink-0">
      {% block content %}{% endblock content %}
    </main>
    <footer class="footer mt-auto py-3 bg-light">
      <div class="container text-center text-muted small">
        <a href="https://bigpotato.com/products/dont-get-got">Don't Get Got!</a>
        es un producto de <a href="https://bigpotato.com/">Big Potato Games</a>.
        Este sitio no está afiliado con ellos. Somos fans del juego y recomendamos
        comprar una copia original para jugarlo físicamente.
        <span class="ps-3"><a href="https://github.com/ChandlerSwift/dont-get-got-online/">código fuente original</a></span>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    {% block footer %}{% endblock footer %}
  </body>
</html>
